    "text": "In an estimation of bromine by Carius method, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of an organic compound gave <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>88</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AgBr</mi></math>. The&nbsp;mass percentage of bromine in the compound is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo></math>Atomic mass, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ag</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Br</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>gmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
